    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "The Deluxe Junior See Saw is a two-seat see saw with Knight Blue seats, built for one pair of children. It suits the 3 to 9 years Key User Group, so a pre-primary child and an older sibling can share it comfortably. Children take turns pushing off the ground, and they soon learn to match each other's timing, which makes it a good first lesson in cooperative play. The see saw measures 7' x 2'3\" and needs a safe play area of 11' x 6'3\". It is a sensible starting piece for a small society garden or a school play corner. Galvanised pipes and roto-moulded seats carry a 3-year warranty, and the pivot bearing is covered for 1 year. Ask us for a quote."
     }
    ]
   }
